{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "56471256-41e4-85e3-978e-699b19e5aa22",
  "created_at": "2025-12-18T13:31:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Frank Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:28:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:28:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, Sandra. Frank Ricci here. I need a copy of a, uh, I think it's a birth certificate? Or is it a certified copy of something? I'm not even sure what to call it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay, we'll figure it out. Is it a birth certificate you're after, for yourself or for somebody else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:29:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For me. I need it for a passport thing, and they said bring a certified, um, long form? Does that mean something different from the regular one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Some people call the full copy the long form. When you ask for a certified copy of your birth record, just tell us it's for a passport and we'll make sure you get the right one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:29:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So can I do it by mail? I'm not wicked able to get down there during the day right now. I'm kind of buried."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, you can request it by mail. You'd send a written request with your full name, date of birth, where you were born, your parents' names, and a copy of your photo ID. Plus the payment and a self-addressed stamped envelope helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:29:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, slow down. A copy of my ID, not the real one. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:29:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, a photocopy. Never mail the real license. Front of it, nice and clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, okay. And the parents' names, is that both, or just my mother's maiden name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both parents if you know them, and yes, include your mother's maiden name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Sorry, I'm in the garage, so if I sound funny, I'm kind of standing over a table. I restore furniture out here, and the whole place smells like varnish. I'm probably getting loopy off it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, you sound fine. Crack the door, though. Especially with this rain, I bet it's all closed up in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's been coming down since yesterday and it finally quit today. Anyway. How long does it take? If I mail it, when would I get it back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail requests usually take a little longer than walking in, since it depends on the mail both ways and how busy we are. I'd say allow a couple of weeks, to be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple weeks. So not like three days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I wouldn't count on three days by mail. If you're up against a deadline, coming in person is faster."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:30:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm. Okay, so, wait, is it the same office for the long form? I thought maybe the state does that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:31:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We handle births that happened here in Newport. If you were born somewhere else, you'd need that city or the state. Were you born in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:31:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, yeah, born and raised, Newport Hospital. Okay, that I'm sure of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:31:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then we're the right place. Do you want me to note a callback number in case there's a question on your request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0188."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:31:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0188. Send it to City Hall, attention City Clerk, vital records."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:31:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall, attention City Clerk. Okay. I think I got it. Photocopy, parents' names, envelope. I'll probably call back if I mess it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, call anytime. Good luck with the passport, Frank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-18T13:31:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Sandra. Take care."
    }
  ],
